-        "Field": "about_popup_content",
-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"The eyes often show the first signs of age, stress, lack of sleep and environmental aggressors. This multi-function eye cream is designed to help smooth the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles on this delicate skin plus help brighten the eye area. A firming complex gives the appearance of a \u201clift\u201d in skin elasticity while hyaluronic acid attracts moisture to the skin. The result is a bright-eyed appearance. \\n\\n Use morning and evening following cleansing and moisturizing. Gently pat a small amount around the eye area. Avoid direct contact with eyes. \\n \"}]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"listType\":\"unordered\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Helps brighten the eye area so you appear more vibrant and less tired\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Helps diminish the look of dark circles\"}]}]}]}"
