-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"This advanced formula now features R\u00e8timel, a proprietary blend of melon super antioxidants and retinol plus a unique combination of amino acids that boosts skin's resilience for effective yet gentle results. This intensely moisturizing cream improves the look of wrinkles, \ufb01ne lines, skin discolorations and skin texture.\\n\\nIn the evening, apply a thin layer onto face. Massage evenly and gently onto skin. Reduce frequency if sensitivity occurs. Sunscreen is recommended daily when using a retinol product.\"}]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"listType\":\"unordered\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Intensely hydrating overnight treatment\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Improves the look of wrinkles and fine lines, skin discolorations and skin texture\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Boosts skin\u2019s resilience for effective yet gentle results\"}]}]}]}"
