-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Modern day living requires a multi-tasking moisturizer. This Anti-Aging Day Cr\u00e8me is specifically formulated to visibly plump, firm and hydrate your skin while providing SPF 30 protection from daily environmental aggressors that can lead to the visible signs of premature aging. Our multi-benefit cream contains hyaluronic acid to help keep skin supple and peptides that visibly reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, enhancing the look of smooth, plump, youthful skin. \\n\\n In the morning, apply to face and neck. Massage gently and evenly onto skin. Reapply as needed. \\n \"}]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"listType\":\"unordered\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Hydrates skin so it looks and feels more supple\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Evens out skin tone\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Protects skin from UV rays and other environmental aggressors\"}]}]}]}"
