-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"This 4-in-1 primer detangles, conditions, smooths, protects hair from heat up to 450\u00b0F, and reduces frizz by 80% for up to 72 hours \u2014 even in high humidity. Hair needs this protection from everyday styling to feel strong, healthy and soft. Vegetable proteins strengthen hair and conditioning agents like panthenol add softness and shine. \\n\\n Use on wet hair before styling, or on dry hair between shampoos for added softness and manageability \u2014 and especially smooth ends. \\n\"}]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"listType\":\"unordered\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Adds shine and reduces frizz\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Protects hair from heat\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Hydrates hair. Adds softness and manageability\"}]}]}]}"
