-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Dr. Sebagh\u2019s famous \u201cmodel\u2019s secret\u201d is named for his unique serum that can boost radiance instantly, which is especially good for dull or dry skin. Cindy often uses Glowing Serum before a red-carpet event or date night with her husband; it\u2019s equally useful before going out for the day or night! This lightweight serum revitalizes, and firming agents help tighten the look and feel of skin for a luminous glow. It also gives subtle highlights under makeup. \\n\\n Use in the morning before applying moisturizer or anytime for an instant radiant glow. Allow product to absorb completely before applying makeup. \\n \"}]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"listType\":\"unordered\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"A firmer, tighter appearance\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Instant radiance boost for dull skin tone and texture\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Moisturized and conditioned skin\"}]}]}]}"
