-        "Field": "about_popup_content",
-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"We take care of our faces, but sometimes forget our necks and d\u00e9collet\u00e9 areas, which are exposed to the same sun rays and environmental aggressors. This rich and silky cream tackles dull, dry skin by visibly firming, brightening, moisturizing and protecting this area. The result is a more smooth, supple, softer look and feel. Use every morning for sun protection. \\n\\n Apply in the morning on cleansed skin. Gently massage onto d\u00e9collet\u00e9 and neck area until completely absorbed. \\n \"}]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"listType\":\"unordered\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Brightens and evens skin tone with minimized appearance of age spots and brown spots\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Gives the look of firmer, tighter skin\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Provides broad spectrum SPF 15 sun protection\"}]}]}]}"
