-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Active ingredients: Avobenzone 3.0%, Octinoxate 7.5%, Octisalate 5.0%, Oxybenzone 5.0% Inactive ingredients: Water, Neopentyl Glycol Diheptanoate, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Butylene Glycol, Cetearyl Alcohol, PEG-40 Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Glyceryl Stearate, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Cucumis Melo (Melon) Fruit Extract, Ascorbyl Methylsilanol Pectinate, Arctostaphylos Uva Ursi Leaf Extract, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Cholesterol, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Biosaccharide Gum-1, Hydrogenated Phosphatidylcholine, Stearate-20, Polysorbate 60, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Alcohol, Sodium Hydroxide, Disodium EDTA, Potassium Sorbate, Chlorphenesin, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance \\n\\n \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Warnings: For external use only. \",\"bold\":true},{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\" Do not use on damaged or broken skin. When using this product, keep out of eyes. Rinse with water to remove. Stop use and ask a doctor if rash occurs. \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\" Keep out of reach of children. \",\"bold\":true},{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\" If product is swallowed, call a poison control center and get medical help right away.\"}]}]}"
