-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"This unique, invigorating scalp spray is the hero product of our Age-Proof Haircare System. It nourishes hair follicles and replenishes vital amino acids, so you can see thicker, fuller, stronger hair. Vitamin H, castor oil, peptides, a plant-based alternative to keratin and a natural wheat protein help pump up hair volume and reduce breakage. The same melon super antioxidants and Melon Leaf Stem Cell Technology used in our skincare protect and moisturize the scalp, because great hair starts with a healthy scalp. \\n\\n Apply directly to entire scalp daily. Gently massage into scalp and style hair as normal. Can be used if hair is wet or dry. \\n \"}]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"listType\":\"unordered\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Reduces hair shedding\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Protects from environmental aggressors\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Nourishes hair follicles and replenishes vital amino acids\"}]}]}]}"
