-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"We\u2019re first in beauty to supercharge our revolutionary serum with Hydrosome H2O, a breakthrough technology designed to deliver ingredients deeper into the skin for better absorption. Upon application, Hydrosome H2O delivers our Melon Leaf Stem Cell Technology and our best-in-class ingredients to visibly plump, firm and deeply hydrate skin and increase elasticity as it helps protect from environmental aggressors. Over time, skin is visibly more youthful and vibrant. \\n\\n Apply 1 pump to cleansed face morning and evening. \\n \"}]},{\"type\":\"list\",\"listType\":\"unordered\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Provides deep hydration\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Visibly plumps and firms skin\"}]},{\"type\":\"list-item\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Enhances radiance for younger-looking skin\"}]}]}]}"
