-        "Field": "description_content",
-        "Value": "Cleanse, condition, protect and nourish! This 4-step haircare system is designed to help restore shine, strength, volume, bounce and elasticity as it revitalizes the scalp for younger-looking hair.\n\nOur Strengthening Shampoo helps replenish hydration while restoring hair\u2019s strength, elasticity and resilience. The Smooth & Shiny conditioner is formulated with a natural silk protein known to double hair shine and amaranth extract for increased gloss and bounce. For softer, more manageable hair and smoother ends, apply the Styling and Protecting Spray to wet or dry hair. It detangles, tames frizz and shields hair from heat up to 450\u00b0F.\n\nThicker, fuller, stronger-looking hair begins at the scalp. Our invigorating Restorative Scalp Treatment features melon super antioxidants and our exclusive Melon Leaf Stem Cell Technology to help nourish hair follicles and replenish vital amino acids \u2014 creating the right environment for beautiful, healthy-looking hair.\n\nNo sulfates added. Safe for color-treated hair."
