-        "Value": "{\"type\":\"root\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Active ingredients: Avobenzone 3.0%, Octinoxate 7.5%, Octisalate 5.0%, Oxybenzone 5.0%\\nInactive ingredients: Water, Neopentyl Glycol Diheptanoate, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Butylene Glycol, Cetearyl Alcohol, PEG-40 Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Glyceryl Stearate, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Cucumis Melo (Melon) Fruit Extract, Ascorbyl Methylsilanol Pectinate, Arctostaphylos Uva Ursi Leaf Extract, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Cholesterol, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Biosaccharide Gum-1, Hydrogenated Phosphatidylcholine, Stearate-20, Polysorbate 60, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Alcohol, Sodium Hydroxide, Disodium EDTA, Potassium Sorbate, Chlorphenesin, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Advertencias: Para uso externo \u00fanicamente.\",\"bold\":true},{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Evita el contacto con los ojos. En caso de contacto con los ojos, enjuaga con cuidado y minuciosamente con agua. Suspende su uso y consulta a un m\u00e9dico si desarrollas irritaci\u00f3n.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Mantenlo fuera del alcance de los ni\u00f1os.\",\"bold\":true},{\"type\":\"text\",\"value\":\"En caso de ingesta, busca atenci\u00f3n m\u00e9dica o ponte en contacto con un Centro de Toxicolog\u00eda de inmediato.\"}]}]}"
