-        "Value": "[\"Skin Brightening D\u00e9collet\u00e9 and Neck Treatment  Broad Spectrum SPF 15 Sunscreen\",\"Glowing Serum\"]"
-    },
-    {
-        "ID": "84238041382",
-        "Handle": "7-piece-deluxe-face-neck-skincare-system",
-        "Command": "MERGE",
-        "Display Name": "7-PIECE SKINCARE SYSTEM",
-        "Status": "Active",
-        "Updated At": "2024-12-30 22:51:54 -0800",
-        "Definition: Handle": "whats_included_section_sas",
-        "Definition: Name": "Whats included section SAS",
-        "Top Row": "",
-        "Row #": "1848",
-        "Field": "product_description_for_additional_item",
-        "Value": "[\"We take care of our faces, but sometimes forget our necks and d\u00e9collet\u00e9 areas, which are exposed to the same sun rays and environmental aggressors. This rich and silky cream tackles dull, dry skin by visibly firming, brightening, moisturizing and protecting this area. The result is a more smooth, supple, softer look and feel. Use every morning for sun protection. <br><br> Apply in the morning on cleansed skin. Gently massage onto d\u00e9collet\u00e9 and neck area until completely absorbed. <br> <ul> <li>Brightens and evens skin tone with minimized appearance of age spots and brown spots</li> <li>Gives the look of firmer, tighter skin</li> <li>Provides broad spectrum SPF 15 sun protection</li> </ul>\",\"Dr. Sebagh\u2019s famous \u201cmodel\u2019s secret\u201d is named for his unique serum that can boost radiance instantly, which is especially good for dull or dry skin. Cindy often uses Glowing Serum before a red-carpet event or date night with her husband; it\u2019s equally useful before going out for the day or night! This lightweight serum revitalizes, and firming agents help tighten the look and feel of skin for a luminous glow. It also gives subtle highlights under makeup. <br><br> Use in the morning before applying moisturizer or anytime for an instant radiant glow. Allow product to absorb completely before applying makeup. <br> <ul> <li>A firmer, tighter appearance</li> <li>Instant radiance boost for dull skin tone and texture</li> <li>Moisturized and conditioned skin</li> </ul>\"]"
-    },
