-        "Value": "[\"<p>Active ingredients: Avobenzone 3.0%, Octinoxate 7.5%, Octisalate 5.0%, Oxybenzone 5.0% <br> Inactive ingredients: Water, Neopentyl Glycol Diheptanoate, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Butylene Glycol, Cetearyl Alcohol, PEG-40 Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Glyceryl Stearate, Glycerin, Dimethicone, Cucumis Melo (Melon) Fruit Extract, Ascorbyl Methylsilanol Pectinate, Arctostaphylos Uva Ursi Leaf Extract, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Magnesium Ascorbyl Phosphate, Cholesterol, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil,  Biosaccharide Gum-1, Hydrogenated Phosphatidylcholine, Stearate-20, Polysorbate 60, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxyethyl Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Alcohol, Sodium Hydroxide, Disodium EDTA, Potassium Sorbate, Chlorphenesin, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance \\t\\t\\t \\t\\t\\t\\t<br><br> \\t\\t\\t\\t \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<strong>Warnings: For external use only.</strong> Do not use on damaged or broken skin. When using this product, keep out of eyes. Rinse with water to remove. Stop use and ask a doctor if rash occurs. <strong>Keep out of reach of children.</strong> If product is swallowed, call a poison control center and get medical help right away.</p>\",\"<p>Water, Butylene Glycol, Hydrolyzed Soy Protein, Glycerin, Propylene Glycol, Isostearyl Isostearate, Arachidyl Alcohol, Sodium Acrylate/Sodium Acryloyldimethyl Taurate Copolymer, Methylpropanediol, Ascorbyl Methylsilanol Pectinate, Triticum Vulgare (Wheat) Bran Extract, Macrocystis Pyrifera (Kelp) Extract, Laminaria Digitata Extract, Cucurbita Pepo (Pumpkin) Fruit Extract, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Peel Oil, Hydrolyzed Vegetable Protein, Tocopheryl Acetate, Ceratonia Siliqua (Carob) Gum, Hydrolyzed Wheat Gluten, Isohexadecane, Polysorbate 80, Behenyl Alcohol, Arachidyl Glucoside, Sodium Chondroitin Sulfate, Magnesium Aspartate, Magnesium Aluminum Silicate, Zinc Gluconate, Copper Gluconate, Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Capryl Glycol, Hexylene Glycol, Polysorbate 20, PVP, BHT, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance (Parfum), Red 4 (CI 14700). \\t\\t\\t \\t\\t\\t\\t<br><br> \\t\\t\\t\\t \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<strong>Warnings: For external use only.</strong> Avoid contact with eyes. If eye contact occurs, flush gently and thoroughly with water. Discontinue use and consult a physician if irritation develops.</p>\"]"
