-    {
-        "ID": "92142928166",
-        "Handle": "7-piece-skincare-system-mb7",
-        "Command": "MERGE",
-        "Display Name": "7-PIECE SKINCARE SYSTEM",
-        "Status": "Active",
-        "Updated At": "2025-01-01 23:02:52 -0800",
-        "Definition: Handle": "whats_included_section_sas",
-        "Definition: Name": "Whats included section SAS",
-        "Top Row": "",
-        "Row #": "2046",
-        "Field": "product_description_for_additional_item",
-        "Value": "[\"We take care of our faces, but sometimes forget our necks and d\u00e9collet\u00e9 areas, which are exposed to the same sun rays and environmental aggressors. This rich and silky cream tackles dull, dry skin by visibly firming, brightening, moisturizing and protecting this area. The result is a more smooth, supple, softer look and feel. Use every morning for sun protection. <br><br> Apply in the morning on cleansed skin. Gently massage onto d\u00e9collet\u00e9 and neck area until completely absorbed. <br> <ul> <li>Broad spectrum SPF 15 sun protection</li> <li>Brighter, more even skin tone with minimized appearance of age spots and brown spots</li> <li>Appearance of firmer, tighter skin</li> <li>Velvety soft, moisturized skin</li> </ul>\",\"Dr. Sebagh\u2019s famous \u201cmodel\u2019s secret\u201d is named for his unique serum that can boost radiance instantly, which is especially good for dull or dry skin. Cindy often uses Glowing Serum before a red-carpet event or date night with her husband; it\u2019s equally useful before going out for the day or night! This lightweight serum revitalizes, and firming agents help tighten the look and feel of skin for a luminous glow. It also gives subtle highlights under makeup. <br><br> Use in the morning before applying moisturizer or any time for an instant pick-me-up and radiant glow. Allow product to absorb completely before applying makeup. <br> <ul> <li>Instant radiance boost for dull skin tone and texture</li> <li>A firmer, tighter appearance</li> <li>Moisturized and conditioned skin</li> <li>Subtle highlights under makeup</li> </ul>\"]"
-    },
